{"parse": {"title": "以骑士之名-08", "pageid": 127818, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-07\" title=\"以骑士之名-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">以骑士之名-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">以骑士之名</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8D.A3.E5.85.89.E7.9A.84.E9.87.8D.E8.B4.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"荣光的重负\">荣光的重负</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 荣光的重负</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Burden of Glory</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱在离医院几百米开外的原野上找到了正在静修的骑士。她没有贸然打扰，坐在骑士身旁不远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低伏的茅草间，骑士长久地端坐，宛如一尊雕像，又或是一块顽石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>骑士应时常沉默静修，在冥想中摒除杂念，洗涤信仰与决心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌，骑士从缄默中拾起言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我们惯于依赖神秘术寻找平静，但偶尔在这种纯然的寂静中，人才能真实地面对自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你看到了什么，阿德海德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我的不堪与愧悔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>在医院外见到骑士们时，我想，“如果他们会前来，我应该留在雷约瓦，拦截车队。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我埋怨自己做出的决定，但即刻便感到毛骨悚然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>没有人能预料未来，在那个时刻，你的选择是正确的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>是啊，我该庆幸的是仍有骑士没有在动乱中忘记自己的品格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>但希尔德加德他们在没有任何命令的情况下毫不犹豫地前来，让我无法逃避自己的不堪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你是骑士团如今的代理团长，需要顾虑的事情更多，不必对自己这么苛刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……这样想的确会让我轻松一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>但我需要厘清我如此执着的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>于是我发现了，我想要一个答案，不仅是为骑士团，也是为自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>——究竟谁该为骑士团的衰败负责？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个残酷的问讯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>重塑之手？一个轻而易举的回答，简单到让事件变得平滑，毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>还是腐朽的王室？但数百年来，我们接受历任皇帝的荫庇，并不因他们的品性而减损我们的辉煌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>也许……骑士团终究会在这个时代走向衰败，骑士精神已是不合时宜的古物，战争只是提前揭露了现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德伸了伸手，止住了玛尔纱的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>所以当我发现你倒在储藏室时，我感到……愧疚和悔恨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>这是在我得知你的“死讯”时就曾面对过的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我不后悔当初将你从雪地里救起，但我后悔没有将你送到某户寻常的家庭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>这样你也不必被骑士的原则束缚，不必压抑自己天性，被骑士的“誓言”塑造成一个随时可舍弃性命的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉痛悄无声息地敲打在玛尔纱心上。这是阿德海德面对自己的“死讯”时，久久无法释怀的心结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>很抱歉让你担心了，阿德海德，但今天的决定是我权衡后的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我也并不后悔成为骑士，修道院的生活让我获得了一生中最宝贵的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是骑士的品格，让我不必在动荡中随波逐流，更让我找到了我应坚守的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱坚定地注视着阿德海德，后者无奈而怜惜地叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我看到了你的决心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>在你情况稳定之后，我离开了储藏室，毕竟医院仍需帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>只是等我回过神来的时候，你已重新回到了走廊，为伤员处理伤口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>尽管你已经不再身着骑士的盔甲，但你与骑士团的同胞没有任何分别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你仍是高地骑士团的一员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冥想的最后时刻，出现在眼前的，是在医院里忙碌的骑士众人，其中正有玛尔纱的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>所以，最后我可以对自己说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>看，阿德海德，骑士精神并未褪色，它仍能成为这个时代守护弱者的“盾”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德转过头，以平等的姿态向另一位骑士承诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你之前说的提议，关于骑士团的重组……我会好好考虑的，玛尔纱修士。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浅金色的晨光之中，一列悬挂着基金会标识的车队停靠在了野战医院外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此时的医院内，玛尔纱结束了例行巡视。听见窗外传来的动静，她连忙从窗边探出头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-312717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-312717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-312717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“剃刀”先生，你终于来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“剃刀”站在车旁，向玛尔纱颔首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在他身后，身着灰白格子服饰的人员开始陆续向医院搬运物资，医护人员鱼贯而入。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>伊琳娜女士，这位是来自基金会的“剃刀”先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱领着伊琳娜来到“剃刀”身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-530901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-530901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-530901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊琳娜：</div><div>“剃刀”先生，非常感谢基金会的援助，这解了医院的燃眉之急。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>不必多谢。我已接到上级指令，接下来会陆续转移医院的重伤员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>四天后，基金会的火车会停靠在镇上的车站，请您提前告知医院众人，做好准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>女士，我也获得了上级批准，会在这儿继续照顾轻伤者，等士兵们恢复之后，和大家一同前往顿河。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>届时，我们可以支援顿河的骑兵军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-530901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-530901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-530901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊琳娜：</div><div>太好了，我这就向大家传达这个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊琳娜走远后，“剃刀”向玛尔纱解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>抱歉，玛尔纱，我们来晚了。迟到真不是一件光彩的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>没关系，我从刻雷乌斯长官那里已得知了原委，你们因为重塑之手才耽误了时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>是的，我们在路上剿灭了一列重塑之手的车队，发现他们当时运送的货物似乎与你们有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱的心重重一跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>玛尔纱，请叫上高地骑士团的众人，随我来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士团成员跟随着“剃刀”来到基金会车队的末端，一辆明显有别于基金会涂装的货车霎时映入眼帘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这是重塑之手的车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>没错，那时恰逢玛尔纱告知医院已解除危险，我们没有了后顾之忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>于是便截停了这列重塑之手的车队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>击败敌军后，我们收缴了车队的物资，在清点的时候发现——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>车里运载的东西属于高地骑士团。因此，基金会决定物归原主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531805.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着“剃刀”打开车厢的门，阿德海德惊讶地上前一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昏暗的车厢里，放置着大量画作，周遭则零星堆积着泛黄的纸张、发灰的银器以及一把蒙尘的断剑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>高地骑士团的账本，会议厅的烛台，还有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一把以花纹钢及精炼铁熔合锻造的剑，剑柄包裹着漆黑的马皮，剑身则断裂成数段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>碎刃之上隐约可见一句短小的拉丁铭文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>“以骑士之名”……这是曾经跟随赫尔曼多年的佩剑，在他死后就已消失不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德捧着断剑，手指轻轻一抹，血色渗进剑身，暗沉的剑身上浮现出幽微的黑蓝色痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>赫尔曼原生的神秘术，附着在剑身之上，能以鲜血唤醒剑身的历史……与真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>赫尔曼曾以这把剑与重塑之手搏斗，剑上保留了重塑之手的术法痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>为消灭证据，重塑之手带走了这把剑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一份人尽皆知的真相，迟来地向众人昭告自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德身后，骑士团众人将佩剑倒插入地面。他们手握剑柄，低头静默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱则双手合十，为赫尔曼无声祷告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>我们并未认出这把剑。但从文件署名上看到了骑士团的名称，不过最直观的证据……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_07\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-3_3_at_07.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-3_3_at_07.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-3_3_at_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“剃刀”揭开了覆盖在画作上的绒布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抖落的尘埃里，庄重而神圣的过去回响起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>噢，玛尔纱接纳礼的画作……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>那时城堡接待了一位颇负盛名的画家，为报答团长的款待，他请求画下骑士的接纳礼，以此作为赠礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>那一天，恰好是玛尔纱授礼的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位普通的骑士，并不会得到画作记录的殊荣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但机缘巧合之下，玛尔纱被授衣的时刻却被永恒定格了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一时刻既独属于玛尔纱，也是骑士们共有的记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在场的每一位骑士，都曾参与过接纳礼，在众多同胞前宣誓，虔诚等待骑士的荣耀降临在自己肩上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我将成为高地骑士团的捍卫者与永恒的朝圣者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我将毫无欺诈地履行誓言，遵循良俗章程与同胞的劝勉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>直至死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱喃喃着，当年的誓言从记忆深处翻涌而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……漫长而艰苦的训练，只是为了这一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>成为“骑士”的这一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>画面上的玛尔纱面容肃穆，身着骑士礼服，合十的双手间藏着对荣光的期盼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数骑士的面容，无论逝去还是幸存，都在此刻与画面上的少女重叠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>骑士们在接纳礼后，便要离开高地城堡，按照团长的指令履行职责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>我们期待着未来的使命，期待自己能有所作为，期待着我们的剑能带回荣誉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到“骑士的荣耀”曝尸荒野，所有人围着它的坟墓徘徊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有画面上的女孩儿，独自走向了一条不受誓言允诺的羊肠小径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小径无法让马儿奔驰，也不便身着盔甲行走。于是她放生了马儿，取下骑士佩剑，将盔甲收进行囊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但臂甲仍留了下来，于是甲面上闪烁着的银光，就此化作了地面的北极星。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……骑士们的确需要一个新的开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>画作被揭开之时，过去与当下的间隙无情地为骑士们切下身上历史的尘垢，鲜血淋漓，却又无比痛快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德取下自己的披风，妥善地将断剑包裹起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>没想到，在我放弃追寻之后，它们反而兜兜转转回到骑士们的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>甚至是在她曾不屑与提防的基金会帮助下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>这并非骑士团最珍贵的物品，值钱的物件可能早已被转运走了。呵……这也不重要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>画作被赠予骑士团后，装饰着城堡的长廊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烛台曾在会议厅燃起火焰，见证骑士们周而复始的礼拜与祈祷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除了那把断剑外，这些曾是城堡里并不算起眼的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但微不足道的物品却将骑士们过往的点滴铺展开，那并非总是光荣的时刻，反而琐碎，却足够真实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>也许……这才是真正价值连城的“财宝”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如同阿德海德始终系在腰间，那块由斯塔希赠送的盾牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>究竟是什么定义了“骑士”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德向自己发问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……那只能是骑士从未向恶妥协的秉性，和拒绝与恶为伍的言行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“这并非荣誉而是重负。”阿德海德，你曾在接纳礼后向我说过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱走到阿德海德身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>是啊，骑士之路不会通往奢靡的享受，骑士要学会忍耐困窘与清贫。维护正义、坚守仁慈向来不是简单的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德注视着玛尔纱，她所想的骑士的未来正鲜明地站在自己身侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>答案触手可及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德转向身后众人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>修士们，从医院离开后，我们要去各地寻找失散的骑士团成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>搜寻过程中，我将采纳玛尔纱修士的意见，尝试将骑士团重组为医疗救援组织。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我们不会再奉陪那些战争游戏，而是回到自己的起点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>未来，我希望骑士们只会为生命“征战”，只与死神为敌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>因此，我们救援的目标将不受国家与民族身份的限制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在场的骑士们议论纷纷，忧虑居多，却没有反对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱静静聆听，并未显得意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>我们不会拒绝这个提议，但这事关所有人的未来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>那便召开骑士团会议吧，流程想必会漫长，但这也是必担的“重负”，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德又看向一旁的“剃刀”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>骑士团如果走在这条路上，总有一日会与基金会合作，只要基金会仍能维持如今的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“剃刀”坦然地行了基金会的礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>愿和平与我们同在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱修士，我希望你能成为骑士团与基金会之间的桥梁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我不会辜负这份使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱郑重地允诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵鲜活而热烈的山风拂过，那是来自朝阳的吐息，将骑士身上陈腐的余烬卷走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世间万物由此显出其原有的轮廓，而骑士们也终于在这一刻，得以将现实的碎片放进“未来”的拼图之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱抬手遮了遮眼，耀眼的光芒自指尖缝隙流淌在她面庞之上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_wululushamo\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_wululushamo\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_wululushamo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>嗯……今天会是个好天气。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-08"}}